                <rect x="47" y="70" width="18" height="14" rx="3" fill="#FBBF24" fill-opacity="0.9"/>
                <line x1="47" y1="102" x2="85" y2="102" stroke="#FFF" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-opacity="0.8"/>
                <line x1="47" y1="110" x2="105" y2="110" stroke="#FFF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-opacity="0.5"/>
                <circle cx="132" cy="74" r="7" fill="#FFF" fill-opacity="0.25"/>
              </g>
              <g style="filter:drop-shadow(0 8px 12px rgba(249,115,22,0.25))">
                <rect x="110" y="25" width="95" height="30" rx="15" fill="#F97316"/>
                <path d="M122 40L126 35H129L126 40H130L124 47L125 41H122Z" fill="#FFF"/>
                <text x="133" y="44" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="10.5" font-weight="800" fill="#FFF">90s Approval</text>
              </g>
              <circle cx="145" cy="115" r="14" fill="#10B981" stroke="#FFF" stroke-width="2.5"/>
              <path d="M140 115L143 118L150 111" stroke="#FFF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <defs><linearGradient id="spCardGrad1" x1="35" y1="55" x2="150" y2="127" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop stop-color="#1A56DB"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#0B1B3D"/></linearGradient></defs>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="hb-sp-meta">
            <span class="hb-sp-step hb-sp-step--orange">Step 01 · Instant Credit</span>
            <span class="hb-sp-tag hb-sp-tag--green">Zero Paperwork</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Buy on Flexible EMI</h3>
          <p>No need to spend entire monthly savings at once. Split any verified product into 3 to 12 flexible monthly installments.</p>
        </div>

                <div class="hb-sp-card hb-reveal">
          <div class="hb-sp-illus">
            <svg width="220" height="160" viewBox="0 0 220 160" fill="none">
              <circle cx="110" cy="80" r="65" fill="#ECFDF5"/>
              <path d="M40 95C60 45 100 45 130 65" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/>
              <circle cx="40" cy="95" r="5" fill="#10B981"/>
              <g style="filter:drop-shadow(0 14px 20px rgba(11,27,61,0.12))">
                <rect x="75" y="55" width="105" height="74" rx="14" fill="#0B1B3D"/>
                <rect x="87" y="40" width="70" height="30" rx="4" fill="#10B981"/>
                <rect x="94" y="47" width="56" height="18" rx="3" fill="#34D399"/>
                <circle cx="122" cy="56" r="4" fill="#059669"/>
                <path d="M150 78H180V102H150C146 102 144 98 144 90C144 82 146 78 150 78Z" fill="#1E293B"/>
                <circle cx="168" cy="90" r="4.5" fill="#FBBF24"/>
              </g>
              <g style="filter:drop-shadow(0 8px 14px rgba(16,185,129,0.25))">
                <rect x="25" y="30" width="105" height="30" rx="15" fill="#10B981"/>
                <text x="37" y="49" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="10.5" font-weight="800" fill="#FFF">100% Day 1 Cash</text>
              </g>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="hb-sp-meta">
            <span class="hb-sp-step hb-sp-step--green">Step 02 · Zero Risk</span>
            <span class="hb-sp-tag hb-sp-tag--blue">Instant UPI</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Sellers Get 100% Upfront</h3>
          <p>Even if the buyer opts for monthly installments, DealBriz settles 100% of your listing price directly into your bank on Day 1.</p>
        </div>

                <div class="hb-sp-card hb-reveal">
          <div class="hb-sp-illus">
            <svg width="220" height="160" viewBox="0 0 220 160" fill="none">
              <circle cx="110" cy="80" r="65" fill="#EEF2FF"/>
              <path d="M110 25L155 42V85C155 115 132 135 110 144C88 135 65 115 65 85V42L110 25Z" fill="#FFF" stroke="#CBD5E1" stroke-width="2.5"/>
              <path d="M110 32L147 47V84C147 110 126 128 110 135C94 128 73 110 73 84V47L110 32Z" fill="#F8FAFC"/>
              <g style="filter:drop-shadow(0 8px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.08))">
